        "eyebrow": "The Cacao Guide · Part 05 of 10",
        "title": "Create Your Own Cacao Ceremony",
        "deck": "You don't need a shaman, an altar, or a two-hour window. You need a cup, some quiet, and the willingness to show up.",
        "meta_read": "13 Min Read",
        "meta_topic": "Ritual &amp; Practice",
        "leaf_url": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0725/1188/1261/files/learn-img-a044820100.png?v=1785782948"
